00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:49.310
We actually call this
"defense in depth."

00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:53.180
And the idea, really, is to
protect your organization

00:03:53.180 --> 00:03:56.700
by eliminating holes, gaps,
and flaws at every layer,

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:59.690
