00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:06.720
So let's get started.

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.960
So to begin with, every
layer is protected

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:12.470
using custom-built hardware
with no unnecessary parts.

00:04:12.470 --> 00:04:15.110
Google manufactures almost
all of its own hardware.

00:04:15.110 --> 00:04:19.370
And any third party never sees
the overall build process.

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:20.959
Last year, we deployed
and introduced

00:04:20.959 --> 00:04:22.715
a security chip called Titan.

00:04:22.715 --> 00:04:25.460
What Titan does-- and it's
installed in every Google

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:26.390
server--

00:04:26.390 --> 00:04:28.550
it really checks every
machine for integrity

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:32.420
every time while
it's booting up.

00:04:32.420 --> 00:04:34.010
And now in that
case, a server is not

00:04:34.010 --> 00:04:35.870
