the network, it's

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:38.720
holding and processing zero
data until its health has

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:39.620
been established.

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:42.440
And that's every single time.

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:44.480
Wherever possible,
we automate things.

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:46.310
So we're relentlessly
and repeatedly

00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:48.410
checking code for
vulnerabilities

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:49.940
before it's deployed.

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:53.030
We automatically encrypt
data at rest and in transit

00:04:53.030 --> 00:04:57.180
