network that I was telling you

00:04:57.180 --> 00:04:58.430
earlier about.

00:04:58.430 --> 00:05:00.500
We maintain a system of
employee permissions,

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:03.920
and we keep all the
machines in the same state.

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:07.400
We have a massive team of
dedicated security engineers

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:09.200
