00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:22.570
So I've talked about
our infrastructure.

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:23.820
I've talked about our network.

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:26.260
I've talked about our data
management capabilities,

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:29.200
and our automation
