00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:53.380
Kubernetes, which hopefully all
of you have heard of by now--

00:05:53.380 --> 00:05:55.480
a pretty popular
product nowadays,

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:58.270
and it's something that is
used for managing software

00:05:58.270 --> 00:05:59.980
